            <p>
              <m>F[\alpha_{1}, \dots, \alpha_{n}]</m> and <m>F(\alpha_{1}, \dots, \alpha_{n})</m>.
            </p>
          </li>

          <li>
            <p>
              <m>F</m>-isomorphism; isomorphism of field extensions
            </p>
