            </p>
          </li>

          <li>
            <p>
              Use the results in this section in reasoning towards solving problems (e.g. argue that a certain polynomial is the irreducible polynomial of some element by showing that it satisfies one of the equivalent conditions in Proposition 15.2.3, or use the fact that <m>F[\alpha]=F(\alpha)</m> is a field when <m>\alpha</m> is algebraic.)
            </p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</p>

